  "bio": "Adélaïde is an illustrious tattoo artist based in Caen, France, known for her exceptional skills in the illustrative tattoo style. Despite an intense travel schedule for guest spots in cities such as Marseille, Montpellier, Hamburg, and London, she remains committed to cleanliness and professionalism ant every step. However, she kindly requests that all inquiries are directed through formal channels rather than through direct messages.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Caen, Normandy, France\n\nTatouages inspirés du Japon, de la céramique et des estampes. \n📍Paris @le.gamin.a.dix.doigts\nPrise de RDV par mail :\n💌 adelaidetattooing@gmail.com",
